  "details": "I wouldn't mind seeing a color picker being added to the user interface for avatar selection. \n\nCall it userColor0 to 4 or something like that. You would get up to 5 generic color pots that the user can adjust which can drive texture/shader colors [set up by the avatar creator if he or she chooses to allow access].\n\nGive access to those color values as variables to avatar makers so they can set a skin color, hair color and a few colors that can plug into whatever shader values the avatars creator sets up on their shaders. \n\nIt's a cheap way to have color variations added to the avatar system, without having multiple avatars in the system which ware simple recolors.",
